            "description": "`address` + `links` (at least one). One bad link -> 422 and nothing is saved. New links are read right away (`refresh` in the response). Saves `propertyId`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"address\": \"1620 N Hoyne Ave, Chicago, IL 60647\",\n  \"links\": [\n    \"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DTOz5t5jLQH/\",\n    \"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DTOz5t5jLQH2/\",\n    \"https://vt.tiktok.com/ZSpaGf8Yp/\"\n  ]\n}",
